	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Choosing One Partner for Strategy, Technology and Mobility]]></title>
		<link>https://example.com/choosing-one-partner-for-strategy-technology-and-mobility/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
