		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://example.com/?p=1015</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Companies expanding across borders need strategy, software and immigration support at the same time. Coordinating three vendors multiplies meetings and misaligned timelines.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>An integrated partner shares context once, owns one plan and reports on one set of milestones. The result is faster execution and a single accountable contact.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

]]></content:encoded>
